{"code":0,"message":"0","ttl":1,"data":[{"tag_id":56,"tag_name":"初音ミク","cover":"http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/c35ba6ef84e82043e4c7ba769d0f90699ef960c1.png","head_cover":"","content":"初音ミク（初音未来）是Crypton于2007年8月31日以VOCALOID 2语音合成引擎为基础开发贩售的虚拟女性歌手软件角色主唱系列的第一作。“初音”是指“第一次的声音（初めての音）”、“出发点”、“最初的VOCALOID 2”；“ミク”汉字写作“未来”，指“VOCALOID所象征的将来音乐之可能性”。CV：藤田咲","short_content":"","type":3,"state":0,"ctime":1436866637,"count":{"view":0,"use":0,"atten":0},"is_atten":0,"likes":0,"hates":0,"attribute":0,"liked":0,"hated":0,"extra_attr":1},{"tag_id":6299,"tag_name":"DECO*27","cover":"http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/940cfc030b55d2dd12be9aff650004a06ee72180.jpg","head_cover":"","content":"· Vocaloid P 人气Master之一。能够作词、作曲、吉他演奏，也能够演唱。初音未来和GUMI的作曲者。知名曲为:爱言叶、二息歩行、弱虫モンブラン、罪と罚。\r\n· 2011年十月与柴咲コウ、TeddyLoid組成新电音乐团「 galaxias! 」出道。","short_content":"","type":3,"state":0,"ctime":1436866637,"count":{"view":0,"use":0,"atten":0},"is_atten":0,"likes":0,"hates":0,"attribute":0,"liked":0,"hated":0,"extra_attr":1},{"tag_id":290,"tag_name":"VOCALOID","cover":"http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/20825058199114b09729dc9bd526adcc360ea503.jpg","head_cover":"http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2ff4ea96b2bcd7f28eded29d5a480a54c15473fe.jpg","content":"VOCALOID是Yamaha所开发的电子音乐制作语音合成软件。输入音调和歌词，便可以合成为人类声音的歌声。","short_content":"创造专属于你自己的虚拟偶像。","type":3,"state":0,"ctime":1436866637,"count":{"view":0,"use":0,"atten":0},"is_atten":0,"likes":0,"hates":0,"attribute":0,"liked":0,"hated":0,"extra_attr":0}]}